msgstr "僅識別網域（明細已壓縮）"

msgid "Includes historical totals. Old domains and rule evidence were removed; displayed samples cover retained details only."
msgstr "包含歷史累計。舊網域和規則證據已刪除，顯示的樣本僅來自保留的明細。"

