msgid "Shadow decision"
msgstr "模擬決策"

msgid "Simulated block; not executed"
msgstr "擬封鎖；未執行"

msgid "Threshold reached; evidence incomplete"
msgstr "達到門檻；證據不完整"

msgid "Decision unavailable"
msgstr "決策無法取得"

msgid "Completed connection replay guards"
msgstr "已結束連線去重游標"

msgid "Zero-byte reports ignored"
msgstr "已忽略的零位元組報告"

msgid "Reports outside the observation window"
msgstr "觀察視窗以外的報告"

msgid "Repeated unresolved reports"
msgstr "重複的未歸屬報告"

msgid "Completed identities compacted"
msgstr "已壓縮的結束連線身分"

msgid "Completed excluded identities released"
msgstr "已釋放的排除連線身分"

msgid "Completed replay guard limit"
msgstr "結束連線去重游標上限"

msgid "Completed connection counter conflicts"
msgstr "已結束連線計數衝突"

msgid "Repeated completed metadata"
msgstr "重複的結束連線中繼資料"

msgid "Previous connection evidence retained"
msgstr "已保留的舊連線證據"

msgid "Unique peers in 60 seconds: 20 can add up to 25 points, 40 up to 35, and 80 up to 40. This weight caps the contribution."
msgstr "最近 60 秒的不同對端：20 個最多加 25 分，40 個最多加 35 分，80 個最多加 40 分；實際加分不超過此權重。"

msgid "Groups with at least 40 peers are also recorded without material upload. These watch-only samples cannot qualify for a simulated block."
msgstr "至少有 40 個對端的連線組，即使沒有實質上傳也會記錄。這類純觀察樣本不會成為模擬封鎖提議。"

msgid "High peer count; observation only"
msgstr "對端數量多；僅供觀察"

msgid "Multiple upload-dominant peers"
msgstr "多個以上傳為主的對端"

msgid "Repeated upload progress"
msgstr "連續上傳進展"

msgid "Fast distribution detection checks new connection bytes every second. It can qualify after 2 MiB across at least 8 upload-dominant peers, without waiting for a full window."
msgstr "快速分發偵測每秒檢查連線新增位元組：至少 8 個以上傳為主的對端、合計達到 2 MiB 後即可滿足流量條件，無需等待完整視窗。"

msgid "Fast detection unavailable:"
msgstr "快速偵測不可用："

msgid "Fast distribution evidence"
msgstr "快速分發證據"

msgid "Seconds observed:"
msgstr "已觀察秒數："

msgid "Connection upload at trigger:"
msgstr "觸發時連線已上傳："

msgid "Fast counter coverage:"
msgstr "快速計數涵蓋連線數："

msgid "Connections without matching DPI identity:"
msgstr "未匹配 DPI 身分的連線："

msgid "Upload distribution across rotating peers"
msgstr "輪換對端的上傳分發"

msgid "Repeated cross-port distribution"
msgstr "持續跨連接埠分發"

msgid "Fast detection combines ports and checks new bytes every second. Bursts need 8 uploading peers; rotating uploads need 4 peers across 3 networks and 2 MiB of distributed evidence. A 30-minute lookback does not require waiting 30 minutes."
msgstr "快速識別每秒檢查新增流量，並跨連接埠彙總。突發分發需 8 個上傳對端；輪換分發需涵蓋 3 個網段的 4 個對端及 2 MiB 分發證據。回看 30 分鐘不代表必須等待 30 分鐘。"

msgid "History alone cannot trigger a decision: new peers need 512 KiB of current upload, returning qualified peers need 32 KiB, with repeated upload progress. VPN and allowlist protections take priority."
msgstr "歷史記錄不能單獨觸發判定：新對端還需本次上傳 512 KiB，已滿足條件的回訪對端需 32 KiB，並持續產生上傳。VPN 和允許清單始終優先。"

msgid "Distribution history unavailable:"
msgstr "分發歷史無法使用："

msgid "Cross-port uploading peers:"
msgstr "跨連接埠上傳對端："

msgid "Distributed upload evidence:"
msgstr "分發上傳證據："

msgid "Cross-port history:"
msgstr "跨連接埠歷史："

msgid "Qualified distribution groups:"
msgstr "達到分發條件的群組："

msgid "Counter sample time:"
msgstr "計數取樣耗時："

msgid "Failed reads:"
msgstr "讀取失敗："

msgid "Recovered reads:"
msgstr "恢復讀取："

msgid "This forwarding path cannot currently enforce automatic blocks. Scoring and observation continue."
msgstr "目前轉發路徑暫不支援自動封鎖，評分和觀察繼續運作。"

msgid "Fast peer diversity counts IPv4 addresses and IPv6 /64 prefixes; multiple addresses do not prove multiple machines."
msgstr "快速識別按 IPv4 位址和 IPv6 /64 前綴計算對端多樣性；多個位址不代表多台機器。"

msgid "Records waiting to be written:"
msgstr "等待寫入的記錄："

msgid "Records lost to recording limits:"
msgstr "因記錄限制而遺失："

msgid "Platform precheck failed; this score is not an executable block."
msgstr "平台預檢未通過；此次評分不代表可以執行封鎖。"
